I Don't Care About Cookies (idcac)

Location in this repo: extensions/idcac-chrome/
Source: https://github.com/apify/idcac
License: GNU General Public License, Version 3 (GPLv3)

Vendored unmodified as a browser extension loaded into Playwright via
--load-extension for automatic cookie-consent dismissal in Agent mode.
