noVNC

Fetched at runtime by start-vnc.sh into /opt/novnc (not vendored in this
repo's source tree) and served to provide the browser-based VNC viewer
for Headful mode.
Source: https://github.com/novnc/noVNC
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

websockify

Used by start-vnc.sh (via novnc_proxy or the standalone websockify
binary) as the WebSocket-to-TCP bridge between the browser VNC viewer
and the Xvfb/x11vnc session in Headful mode.
Source: https://github.com/novnc/websockify
License: GNU Lesser General Public License, Version 3 (LGPLv3)
